<DocsLayout title="Lua & LSL Docs">
<div class="dashboard summary-constant">
  <div class="dashboard-header">
    <span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span><DocsCode code={`CHARACTER_AVOIDANCE_MODE: number = 5`} lang="slua" /></span>
    <span class="lsl-section"><span class="tag lsl-tag">LSL</span><DocsCode code={`integer CHARACTER_AVOIDANCE_MODE = 5;`} lang="lsl" /></span>
  </div>

  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>The integer constant CHARACTER_AVOIDANCE_MODE has the value 5</p>
  <p>Used in the functions of pathfinding . Is combined with a mask bit flags. The default is AVOID_CHARACTERS with AVOID_DYNAMIC_OBSTACLES.
Allows you to specify that a character should not try to avoid other characters, should not try to avoid dynamic obstacles (relatively fast moving objects and avatars), or both.</p>
</p>
    </div>

    <div class="dash-col">
      <div class="dash-section-title">Member Of</div>
